        "id": 1927775
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-12-29T17:25:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I have a general consideration in this MTU setup. Wouldn\u0027t it be good enough just to request maximum possible MTU on every channel ? Profiles/services would only check if they can work with such MTU if not - then disconnect them.",
      "revId": "e4dbc443c8d963e813ee04129b1242f7fa4e60cd",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
