        "id": 1929540
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-01-12T13:25:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "do you mean GATT to set maximum MTU after connection, no matter if there is a request for that?\n\nThis was my first idea, but then we conclude to do that only whenever there is user which requires anything more then default so we are not changing previous behavior too much.\n\nEventually we might do that as well.",
      "parentUuid": "a4491c89_498ac227",
